# Heftin Academy frontend

Read `AGENTS.md` before coding.

- E-examination product only (not NexGen Athlete)
- Vite + React 19 + TypeScript + Tailwind v4
- One Axios client: `src/lib/axios.ts`
- API in `src/services/`; types in `src/types/`
- Pages thin; `@/` imports; `cn()` for classNames
- Branch from `dev`: `feature/<TASK-ID>-slug`
- Do not merge without approval; never push `main`
